    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The network's first historical military theme IP interactive video game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Conquer the world&quot; is a historical theme of live-action interactive film game, adapted from Hui Xiongmao's the historical military novel &quot;FaQing&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are the feelings of the family and the country, the great justice of the world.  You will cross the river of history, save people, Against the invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there's a very long plot, a lot of branching endings.  Be the king, or to save the son of heaven, you can choose freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a wide variety of gameplay.  Arsenal, shop and other new gameplay to bring you to experience a different interactive game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IP blockbuster,Film feast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;FaQing&quot; legitimate IP authorization, the whole network's first historical military theme interactive film game. The first perspective of immersive interaction, real scene interpretation, let you personally come to the battlefield, experience that unforgettable history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lots of branches, lots of endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >512 episodes, 268 choices, take you to 87 endings. Massive plot, infinite possibilities, every choice you make, will open a different plot, usher in unexpected endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A variety of interactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic female general, rich and resourceful rich woman sister, white-haired girl, charming mixed-race female businessman, lovely Miao saint girl, proud princess.  The six beautiful women can not only accompany you in the story, but also interact with you outside the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden exploration, rich gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the plot, the treasure chest in the corner will bring unexpected surprises. Outside the plot, the weapons in the Arsenal will turn the tide of the war for you... There are more rich gameplay, take you to experience a different interactive game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We are Interactive Star Studio,</strong> <strong>you can follow our official channels in order to get the latest official information:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Douyin\uff1a\u4f10\u5b9a\u5929\u4e0b\u00a0 46293741012</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili\uff1a\u4f10\u5b9a\u5929\u4e0b\u00a0 \u00a0141436551</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WeiBo\uff1a\u4f10\u5b9a\u5929\u4e0b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official QQ Group\uff1a971686993</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
